<h1 class="page-title" data-page-title-uuid="00000000-0000-856b-944c-412bf8dca640">Klingon Diplomatic Greeting Drafting <a class="source-link" href="https://claude.ai/chat/c0000003-1701-4d00-8000-00000000c003" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a></h1>

<div id="m-0b75b540-c500-844a-b73a-e6dbe1ab76d7" data-section-uuid="0b75b540-c500-844a-b73a-e6dbe1ab76d7" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">Human</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-14T10:00:00+00:00" title="2369-04-14 10:00:00 UTC">Mon Apr 14th, 2369 at 10:00</time>

Look up the Klingon greeting "nuqneH" and propose a respectful opening line for a diplomatic dispatch to Chancellor K'mpec.

</div>

<div id="m-0b75b541-3a30-89b3-8db9-add265c34f05" data-section-uuid="0b75b541-3a30-89b3-8db9-add265c34f05" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">claude-opus-4-7</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-14T10:00:30+00:00" title="2369-04-14 10:00:30 UTC">Mon Apr 14th, 2369 at 10:00</time>

<details><summary>Thinking</summary>

> "nuqneH" literally means "what do you want" — it's blunt by Federation standards but standard among Klingons. I should fetch a phrasebook to confirm register before recommending an opening.

</details>

</div>

<details class="tool-group">
<summary>🛠 1 tool step</summary>

<div id="m-0b75b541-4200-8abc-b9a3-3edad069d109" data-section-uuid="0b75b541-4200-8abc-b9a3-3edad069d109" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">claude-opus-4-7</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-14T10:00:32+00:00" title="2369-04-14 10:00:32 UTC">Mon Apr 14th, 2369 at 10:00</time>

<details><summary>Tool use: web_fetch — Fetching: Klingon language reference</summary>

```json
{
  "url": "https://memory-alpha.test/wiki/Klingon_language"
}
```
</details>

</div>

</details>

<div id="m-0b75b541-af60-8133-840a-94a11a820014" data-section-uuid="0b75b541-af60-8133-840a-94a11a820014" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">claude-opus-4-7</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-14T10:01:00+00:00" title="2369-04-14 10:01:00 UTC">Mon Apr 14th, 2369 at 10:01</time>

For a dispatch to Chancellor K'mpec, open with "qaleghneS, Chancellor — nuqneH?" ("I am honored to see you — what do you want?"). The honorific softens the bluntness of nuqneH; together they read as warm-but-direct, which Klingons respect.

</div>

<details class="tool-group">
<summary>🛠 1 tool step</summary>

