</details>

<div id="m-0b75c9a5-1b40-8e11-8da0-3daa248fd980" data-section-uuid="0b75c9a5-1b40-8e11-8da0-3daa248fd980" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">Human</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-18T09:02:00+00:00" title="2369-04-18 09:02:00 UTC">Fri Apr 18th, 2369 at 09:02</time>

